  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0-preview.3: Docs and packaging refresh — the library binary is identical to 1.0.0-preview.2 (no code change). The package README now links the runnable samples with absolute URLs (so they resolve on the NuGet page) and points at the live playground at https://pqjwt.systemslibrarian.dev; the sample Dockerfiles were fixed to provide OpenSSL 3.5, which ML-DSA/ML-KEM require. The preview.N suffix continues to carry the maturity caveat: NOT independently audited, NOT for production. Full notes: https://github.com/systemslibrarian/postquantum-jwt/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md — known limitations: https://github.com/systemslibrarian/postquantum-jwt/blob/main/KNOWN-GAPS.md.",
